5023c7fe-3246-4c75-b146-d02218c94075	pathology_micro	BDS-I	A "Bull Neck" appearance due to massive cervical edema is a characteristic complication of:	{Actinomycosis,Diphtheria,Mumps,Tetanus}	1	Bull Neck (Neck edema) is a dangerous complication of Diphtheria .	Clinical Bacteriology	\N
8d4248b5-5beb-4c6e-a707-c505950a2dc0	pathology_micro	BDS-I	Which diagnostic test determines whether an individual requires immunization against Diphtheria?	{"Schick test","Dick test","Lepromin test","Mantoux test"}	0	The Schick test determines susceptibility to Diphtheria. If positive, it indicates a lack of immunity and the need for immunization .	Diagnostic Tools	\N
