ba814f6c-6126-4ec9-a180-b788878d0198	materials	BDS-I	"Metamerism" in shade matching refers to:	{"Two teeth having different shades","An object appearing different under different light sources","The intensity of a color","The ability to transmit light"}	1	Metamerism is the phenomenon where the same color sensation is produced by different light absorption spectra, causing an object to look different under different light sources.	Shade Selection	\N
