57f9dcc5-60da-4a66-8e1d-3f4d424945d4	orthodontics	BDS-I	Continuous video microscopy studies reveal that human tooth eruption follows a circadian rhythm, peaking during which timeframe?	{"8 AM to Noon","2 PM to 6 PM","8 PM to Midnight","2 AM to 6 AM"}	2	Short-term movements track eruption occurring primarily during a critical period between 8 PM and midnight or 1 AM.	Eruption Timing	\N
