e4738c0b-e02b-41cb-baec-22868f5cabd9	public_health	BDS-I	"Incremental Dental Care" is a strategy that focuses on:	{"Treating all adults first","Periodic care for specific age groups (starting with the youngest)","Only treating emergency pain","Providing free care for the elderly"}	1	By treating children systematically as they age, you ensure a cohort of the population reaches adulthood with a healthy, maintained dentition.	School Dental Health Program	\N
