5522d676-0bf4-4164-bb17-4b735e6bfe0c	public_health	BDS-I	Which stage of the "Transtheoretical Model" describes a person who has no intention of quitting tobacco in the next 6 months?	{Pre-contemplation,Contemplation,Preparation,Action}	0	Pre-contemplation is the "denial" stage where the person is unaware or unwilling to acknowledge the need for change.	Behavioral Sciences in Dentistry	\N
f6c2e2b3-9d83-4882-ae35-4113d2cedf1f	public_health	BDS-I	"Summative Evaluation" of a public health program is conducted:	{"During the initial survey","During the implementation phase","At the end of the program","Every month"}	2	Summative evaluation assesses the final impact and whether the original objectives were met after the program is concluded.	Planning and Evaluation	\N
