f87cc5b3-6927-4807-ba77-67817cc1181f	public_health	BDS-I	A score of "8" in Russell’s Periodontal Index signifies:	{"Healthy gingiva","Early gingivitis","Advanced destruction with loss of masticatory function","A deep pocket of 4mm"}	2	Score 8 is the terminal stage of the index, indicating severe periodontal disease and tooth mobility.	Indices in Dental Epidemiology	\N
