b2eb1761-36a9-4329-9a8e-a21be6af91d0	oral_surgery	BDS-I	A patient with a temperature of 103°F and malaise is showing signs of:	{"Localized infection","Systemic involvement (Sepsis risk)","Allergic reaction to latex","Simple dental anxiety"}	1	High fever and malaise are constitutional signs of systemic spread. [Box 1-4, Infection Focus]	Odontogenic Infection	\N
