21132e23-f977-4cc0-8e8d-316cbdacac77	anatomy	BDS-I	A patient has a "Beefy red tongue." Which condition is suspected?	{"Vitamin C deficiency","Pernicious anemia",Fluorosis,Measles}	1	Pernicious anemia and Vitamin B deficiencies lead to a beefy red tongue.	Tongue	\N
