e2ca24db-838a-4207-922e-c0d8d39ad4af	physiology_biochem	BDS-I	In "Folate Trap," a deficiency of B12 leads to a functional deficiency of Folate. This is because:	{"Folate is degraded by B12","Folate remains trapped as N5-methyl THF","B12 is required for Folate absorption","Folate cannot be converted to DHF"}	1	Without B12, N5-methyl THF cannot transfer its methyl group to homocysteine, trapping folate in a form that cannot be reused.	Vitamins	\N
