7a6b851a-f786-48ef-9880-5813f61350ba	physiology_biochem	BDS-I	Which amino acid is "conditionally essential" in children with Phenylketonuria (PKU)?	{Phenylalanine,Tyrosine,Tryptophan,Methionine}	1	In PKU, the enzyme converting Phenylalanine to Tyrosine is defective. Therefore, Tyrosine cannot be synthesized and must be supplied in the diet.	Amino Acid Metabolism	\N
