eab5a00f-cffb-4046-9e0b-28f84614450e	physiology_biochem	BDS-I	A 15-year-old in DKA has a "fruity odor" to his breath. This is due to the exhalation of:	{Acetoacetate,Beta-hydroxybutyrate,Acetone,Glucose}	2	Acetone, a volatile ketone body produced by the spontaneous decarboxylation of acetoacetate, is exhaled, giving the breath a fruity odor.	Carbohydrate Metabolism	\N
