8a08632c-08fe-4465-af2f-69fd0f27587c	dental_anatomy	BDS-I	The auricular hillocks form the ear from which arches?	{"I only","II only","I and II","II and III"}	2	The ear forms from Arches I and II.	Ear Development	\N
29f907cd-ae96-47fb-ba98-e9783fa638b5	dental_anatomy	BDS-I	Hunter-Schreger bands are visible as light and dark bands when viewed with:	{"Transmitted light","Reflected light","Electron microscope","Frozen sections"}	1	Usually seen with reflected light.	Enamel Histology	\N
